# `cargo tauri dev` restarts the app when a watched file changes. When
# ui/dist is missing, build.rs runs npm in ui/, and npm's own writes would
# otherwise restart the build that ran them, over and over. Ignore just those
# outputs: ignoring all of ui/ hides ui/package.json, and the CLI then can't
# find the frontend to run `npm run dev` in.
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/package-lock.json
ui/*.tsbuildinfo
